nakaupo dito
nakikinig sa kalokohan na yan?

222
00:17:59.496 --> 00:18:01.247
walang kwenta? Ikaw maliit…

223
00:18:01.331 --> 00:18:03.625
totoo naman. Ibig kong sabihin, isipin mo ito.

224
00:18:03.708 --> 00:18:06.336
- Sa tingin mo ba ay may katuturan ang Angel Village?
- Siyempre, ginagawa nito. Ikaw brat.

225
00:18:06.419 --> 00:18:07.420
ginagawa ba ito?

226
00:18:13.843 --> 00:18:14.886
<i>Ano ba?</i>

227
00:18:15.386 --> 00:18:16.805
<i>Bakit napakalinaw ng kanyang balat?</i>

228
00:18:18.097 --> 00:18:19.182
Enjoy.

229
00:18:19.724 --> 00:18:21.059
Ay, salamat.

230
00:18:23.895 --> 00:18:24.896
Sus, sobrang init.

231
00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:26.606
lava ba ito?

232
00:18:30.193 --> 00:18:31.152
<i>Maghintay.</i>

233
00:18:31.903 --> 00:18:33.822
<i>Pambihira rin siya.</i>

234
00:18:38.701 --> 00:18:39.744
Huwag kang mag-alala.

235
00:18:43.331 --> 00:18:44.165
<i>Tama.</i>

236
00:18:44.916 --> 00:18:47.126
<i>Kahit ang mga matandang babae doon.</i>

237
00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.337
<i>Ang kanilang balat ay kumikinang na parang baliw.</i>

238
00:18:53.716 --> 00:18:54.592
<i>Muli?</i>

239
00:18:55.134 --> 00:18:58.429
<i>Kahit ang mga babae sa labas ay maganda lahat.</i>

240
00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:04.060
<i>Paano lahat ng tao dito ay may magandang balat?</i>

241
00:19:04.561 --> 00:19:05.395
<i>Siguro...</i>

242
00:19:10.859 --> 00:19:11.693
sa tingin ko…

243
00:19:11.776 --> 00:19:13.027
{\an8}PAGANDA NG TONER

244
00:19:13.111 --> 00:19:15.321
{\an8}…baka alam mo kung ano ito.

245
00:19:18.074 --> 00:19:19.617
"Pampaganda ng Toner."

246
00:19:20.201 --> 00:19:22.495
Girl group name ba yun?

247
00:19:23.413 --> 00:19:24.247
tapos…

248
00:19:25.957 --> 00:19:26.916
