00:46:46.804 --> 00:46:47.722
tapos…

664
00:46:48.890 --> 00:46:51.726
Ang mukha.
Okay lang ba na ipahid sa mukha?

665
00:46:51.809 --> 00:46:53.937
ano? Delikado yan.

666
00:46:54.020 --> 00:46:55.647
May malapit na saradong minahan,

667
