684
00:48:02.505 --> 00:48:03.923
Oo, Keunhani Village.

685
00:48:04.007 --> 00:48:06.301
Keunhani Village
dahil sa malaking sama ng loob.

686
00:48:06.384 --> 00:48:08.636
Jageunhani Village
dahil sa maliit na sama ng loob.

687
