Hindi, ito ay pangunahing lamig
at kaunting lamig.

688
00:48:12.098 --> 00:48:14.475
Dahan at Sohan.
Wala namang ibang ibig sabihin.

689
00:48:15.560 --> 00:48:16.394
pagkatapos,

690
00:48:17.854 --> 00:48:19.314
